    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present Three Ways, Maghery, Dungloe, Co. Donegal to the open market, a well-positioned two-bedroom property situated in the popular coastal area of Maghery.\n\nOccupying a pleasant setting, one of the property`s standout features is its excellent location, being within walking distance of Maghery Beach, offering convenient access to the beautiful coastline and scenery for which the area is renowned.\n\nInternally, the accommodation is laid out on one level and comprises an Entrance Hall, spacious Living Room / Dining Room, Kitchen, Two well-proportioned Bedrooms, with Bedroom 1 benefiting from an En-Suite, together with a separate Bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large garden area, providing generous outdoor space surrounding the property with excellent potential for recreation, entertaining or further landscaping. The property also benefits from a separate shed, providing useful additional storage space.\n\nThe property is conveniently located within easy reach of Dungloe, with its wide range of shops, schools, restaurants and everyday amenities, while the surrounding Maghery area is renowned for its beaches, rugged coastline and peaceful setting.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and by STRICT appointment with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: K1295\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.89m (6'2\") x 1.85m (6'1\")\nSliding Door, Tiled\n\nLiving Room / Dining Room - 6.17m (20'3\") x 5.55m (18'3\")\nSolid Wood Floor, Open Fire\n\nKitchen - 2.74m (9'0\") x 1.76m (5'9\")\nTiled Floor, Fitted Units\n\nHallway - 1.86m (6'1\") x 1.3m (4'3\")\nSolid Wood Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m (12'6\") x 2.91m (9'7\")\nSolid Wooden Floor\n\nEn Suite (Bed 1) - 2.74m (9'0\") x 1.32m (4'4\")\nFully Tiled, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.66m (12'0\") x 2.75m (9'0\")\nSolid Wood Floor\n\nBathroom - 2.42m (7'11\") x 1.32m (4'4\")\nTiled Floor & Wall, Electric Shower, Toilet, Hand Basin\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
